  "description": "Device-link conformance. Envelope: X25519(own ephemeral private, peer ephemeral public) -> HKDF-SHA256(salt empty, info \"Obscura link v1\", 32 bytes) -> AES-256-GCM(12-byte nonce, no associated data) over the serialized LinkBundle; ciphertext is ciphertext || 16-byte tag. Public keys are libsignal serialized (0x05 || 32 bytes), private keys 32 raw bytes, identityKeyPair is libsignal IdentityKeyPair.serialize(). Byte strings are lowercase hex. Link codes are base64url without padding of a serialized LinkCode. Sealing plaintext with key and nonce yields ciphertext exactly; a kit's own encoding of a LinkBundle, LinkEnvelope or LinkCode is compared with plaintext, linkEnvelope or code by decoded value.",
